# ── Line endings ──
#
# The corpora in data/source/ are parsed BYTE-EXACTLY, so no platform may rewrite them.
# quran-morphology.txt is tab-separated and its LAST field is the feature string: a CRLF
# checkout leaves a stray \r on every feature list, which makes /(?:^|\|)P(?:\||$)/ stop
# matching and takes preposition detection with it — the expressions build silently drops
# from 1458 government frames to 0, while the tag-driven analyses (collocations, compounds)
# carry on looking healthy. That is a very expensive hour to spend, and it only happens on
# Windows, so it will only ever be found by whoever is least expecting it.
#
# `-text` means: check these out exactly as they are stored. They are stored with LF.
data/source/** -text
